From: Iltix <dev@iltix.de>
Date: Sat, 19 Apr 2026 00:00:04 +0000
Subject: Iltix Module: Auto-Hide Navigation

Implements scroll-triggered hide/show animation for the navigation bar:
- Scrolling down: nav bar slides out with a smooth animation (translationY)
- Scrolling up: nav bar slides back in
- Fullscreen: website is visible without any nav bar obstruction
- Respects the existing "Always show toolbar" (Toolbar Scroll Ablation) setting:
  if that setting is enabled, the Auto-Hide module is a no-op.
- Implements a scroll threshold before reacting to prevent jitter on micro-scrolls.

The module is gated by IltixModuleManager.isAutoHideEnabled().
When disabled, bar visibility is 100% stock Cromite behaviour.

Requires: Iltix-Module-Settings-Infrastructure.patch

